            "detailed_description": "<strong>If you purchased this game prior to Sept 2017, please contact us for a complimentary key to The Afterwoods. Aftter we're able to validate proof of purchase, we'll send you a key. Thanks!</strong><br><br>-------<br>In this VR adventure you are the long foretold mage who will restore life to Teratini, a land decimated by invaders. To succeed in your quest, you'll need to train dragons, wield a magic staff, and learn to fly to defeat enemies and reclaim land that was lost long ago. <br><br>Set in a fantasy world, Teratini VR game play is a cross between tennis, dodge ball, and sword fighting. <br><br>Neat Stuff<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many enemy variations, abilities, and attack formations. <br></li><li> Train, fight, and level up with your dragon.  </li></ul><br>Things to know before you buy or try<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Not the best game if you are sensitive to heights. </li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>If you purchased this game prior to Sept 2017, please contact us for a complimentary key to The Afterwoods. Aftter we're able to validate proof of purchase, we'll send you a key. Thanks!</strong><br><br>-------<br>In this VR adventure you are the long foretold mage who will restore life to Teratini, a land decimated by invaders. To succeed in your quest, you'll need to train dragons, wield a magic staff, and learn to fly to defeat enemies and reclaim land that was lost long ago. <br><br>Set in a fantasy world, Teratini VR game play is a cross between tennis, dodge ball, and sword fighting. <br><br>Neat Stuff<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many enemy variations, abilities, and attack formations. <br></li><li> Train, fight, and level up with your dragon.  </li></ul><br>Things to know before you buy or try<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Not the best game if you are sensitive to heights. </li></ul>",
            "short_description": "In this VR adventure, you are the Dragon Mage who glides through the air, smashes attacks back at opponents, and beckons a dragon when the going gets rough. Invent new moves and perfect them in the Sanctuary before taking back Teratini.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
